              "value": "Necrotic Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, negative)\n\nWhen Kharostan dies, his daemon-tainted flesh quickly rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 10-foot emanation around his body. All creatures within the area take 20d6 negative damage as their flesh curdles and rots as well (37 basic Fortitude save)."
