    "free_actions": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Reckless Abandon"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(rage)\n\nTrigger: Kharostan's turn begins and he has 140 or fewer Hit Points\n\nKharostan throws caution to the wind to finish the fight. He gains a +2 status bonus to attack rolls, a \u20132 status penalty to AC, and a \u20131 status penalty to saves. He can also make a Wicked Bite each time he damages a creature with his jaws Strike, in addition to the usual once per round usage for a free action. These effects last until his rage ends or he has more than 140 Hit Points, whichever comes first."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "free_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
